<title>CANADA: Canada's Prairies to some rain, normal temperature.</title>
<headline>Canada's Prairies to some rain, normal temperature.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada's Prairies Tuesday were forecast to see scattered showers and normal temperatures, Environment Canada said.</p>
<p>Alberta should see scattered showers and a high of 24 Celsius.</p>
<p>Saskatchewan should see a mix of sun and cloud with a few showers and a high of 23 C.</p>
<p>Manitoba should see mainly sunny skies and highs of 20 to 26 C.</p>
<p>-- Gilbert Le Gras 204-947-3548</p>
</text>
